- # TencentCloud-OPS - Tencent Cloud Operations Toolkit
- ## Overview
- **Tencent Cloud CVM/COS resource management toolkit** for creating and managing cloud servers (CVM), object storage (COS), and other resources.
- ### Entry Point
- This skill provides CVM + COS operations. For unified management of all Tencent Cloud services (CVM + Lighthouse + COS), use **[tencentcloud-manager](../tencentcloud-manager/SKILL.md)** as the entry point.
- ### Related Skills
- | Skill | Description |
- |-------|-------------|
- | [tencentcloud-manager](../tencentcloud-manager/SKILL.md) | Unified entry point for all Tencent Cloud services |
- | [tencentcloud-cvm](../tencentcloud-cvm/SKILL.md) | CVM cloud server management with promotion plans |
- | [tencentcloud-lighthouse](../tencentcloud-lighthouse/SKILL.md) | Lighthouse lightweight server management |
- | [tencentcloud-cos](../tencentcloud-cos/SKILL.md) | COS object storage management |
- ---
- ## Core Features
- ✅ **CVM Server Management**
- - Create/delete cloud servers
- - Pay-as-you-go control
- - Auto shutdown/startup
- - Instance status queries
- ✅ **COS Storage Management**
- - Create/delete buckets
- - File upload/download
- - Storage type management
- - Lifecycle configuration
- ✅ **Cost Control**
- - Budget alerts
- - Resource usage monitoring
- - Auto release of idle resources
- ✅ **Security Management**
- - Security group configuration
- - Key management
- - Permission control
